#. module: certification_organism
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:certification_organism.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"From the <strong>map view</strong>, your agents see where they need to head "
"for their interventions of the day. This visual aid will also help you plan "
"tasks so that each agent covers a specific area."
msgstr ""
"I <strong>kortvisningen</strong> kan agenterne se, hvor de skal hen for at "
"udføre dagens opgaver. Den visuelle oversigt gør det samtidig nemmere at "
"planlægge opgaver, så hver medarbejder dækker et bestemt område."

#. module: certification_organism
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:certification_organism.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Get an <strong>overview of the ratings</strong> you are receiving from the "
"'Field Service &amp;gt; Reporting &amp;gt; Customer Ratings' menu."
msgstr ""
"Få et <strong>samlet overblik over de bedømmelser</strong>, du har modtaget, "
"via menuen 'Udenforstående &amp;gt; Rapporter &amp;gt; Kundebedømmelser'."

#. module: certification_organism
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:certification_organism.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Get reporting on the various fields you are tracking during your "
"interventions. Identify recurring sources of issues and detect warning signs "
"of future potential issues."
msgstr ""
"Du modtager rapporter om de områder, du følger i forbindelse med dine "
"opgaver. Brug dem til at identificere tilbagevendende problemområder og "
"opdage tidlige advarselssignaler på kommende udfordringer."

#. module: certification_organism
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:certification_organism.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Go back to the Quotation you had previously created, and hit that "
"'<strong>Confirm</strong>' button. Your Quotation is now a <strong>Sales "
"Order.</strong>"
msgstr ""
"Gå tilbage til dit tidligere oprettede tilbud, og klik på '<strong>Bekræft</"
"strong>'. Tilbuddet konverteres nu til en <strong>salgsordre.</strong>"

#. module: certification_organism
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:certification_organism.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Go to 'Configuration &amp;gt; Worksheet Templates' and click on "
"'<strong>Analysis</strong>' from your '<strong>Worksheet Template</strong>' "
"form view."
msgstr ""
"Gå til 'Konfiguration og arbejdsseddelskabeloner', og klik på "
"'<strong>Analyse</strong>' i formularvisningen "
"'<strong>Arbejdsseddelskabelon</strong>'."

#. module: certification_organism
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:certification_organism.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Go to 'Dashboards &amp;gt; Projects' to get an overview of your tasks. <span "
"style=\"color: inherit; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; background-"
"color: inherit;\">Use predefined </span>\n"
"                    <span style=\"color: inherit; font-style: normal; "
"background-color: inherit;\"><strong>dashboards</strong></span>\n"
"                    <span style=\"color: inherit; font-style: normal; font-"
"weight: 400; background-color: inherit;\"> or build your own with the "
"advanced reporting engine. Share filters with the team.</span>"
msgstr ""
"Gå til 'Dashboards &amp;gt; Projekter' for at få et overblik over dine "
"opgaver. <span style=\"color: inherit; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; "
"background-color: inherit;\">Brug foruddefinerede </span>\n"
"                    <span style=\"color: inherit; font-style: normal; "
"background-color: inherit;\"><strong>dashboards,</strong></span>\n"
"                    <span style=\"color: inherit; font-style: normal; font-"
"weight: 400; background-color: inherit;\"> eller opret dine egne med den "
"avancerede rapportfunktion. Del filtre med teamet.</span>"

#. module: certification_organism
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:certification_organism.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Go to Reporting &amp;gt; <strong>Tasks Analysis</strong> to get statistics "
"on your tasks and to analyze the performance of your projects."
msgstr ""
"Gå til Rapportering &amp;gt; <strong> Opgaveanalyse</strong> for at se "
"statistikker over dine opgaver og analysere dine projekters præstation."

#. module: certification_organism
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:certification_organism.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Go to the 'Configuration &amp;gt; Stages' menu. Then define a "
"'<strong>Rating Email Template</strong>' on your 'Done' stage (or any other "
"one you'd like). This will automatically send a <strong>rating request</"
"strong> to the\n"
"                    customer once the task reaches this stage."
msgstr ""
"Gå til menuen 'Konfiguration &amp;gt; Faser'. Definér derefter en '<strong>e-"
"mailskabelon</strong>' til vurdering for fasen 'Udført' (eller en anden fase "
"efter eget valg). Der sendes automatisk en <strong>bedømmelsesanmodning</"
"strong> til\n"
"                    kunden, når opgaven når denne fase."

#. module: certification_organism
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:certification_organism.welcome_article_body
msgid "Guide to the Certification Auditors Industry"
msgstr "Vejledning til certificeringsinspektører"

#. module: certification_organism
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:certification_organism.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Here, we will be <strong>invoicing</strong> our customer after our "
"intervention is done (see the 'Invoicing Policy' defined as 'Based on "
"Delivered Quantity (Manual)'. However, you could also bill your customer "
"right away by\n"
"                    configuring the 'Invoicing Policy' as 'Fixed Price/"
"Prepaid'."
msgstr ""
"I dette tilfælde udsteder vi først <strong>fakturaen</strong> til kunden, "
"når opgaven er afsluttet (se 'faktureringspolitik', defineret som 'Baseret "
"på leveret mængde (manuel)'). Du kan dog også vælge at fakturere kunden med "
"det samme ved\n"
"                    at konfigurere faktureringspolitikken som 'Fast pris/"
"forudbetaling'."

